  "schematicNotes": [
    {
      "id": "n_cavity_notes",
      "text": "GEARBOX SPEED SENSOR NOTE\nGearbox VSS (Toyota 83181-20040), pin 3 speed output to BH-B pin 89, then ECU B29 (DI 8). Actual road speed. 12 V direct, no divider - the Link DI is +/-50 V tolerant with a selectable 4k7 pull-up to 12 V. PCLink DI 8 pull-up ON (sot/channels.csv B29).",
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 1860,
        "y": 840
      },
      "width": 390
    },
    {
      "id": "n_drb102",
      "width": 390,
      "color": "Orange",
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 330,
        "y": 1200
      },
      "text": "BULKHEAD = ONE DRB102 CONNECTOR (Daniel 2026-10-12, shared-connector rule). bh_b_eng is the whole 102-cavity plug with TE's cavity numbers. A and B are only our names for its sections. Cavities marked N/C here are wired on ST185-A-engine - see ST185-A-engine (DRB 1-2, 9-42, 44-47, 50-53, 56-59, 61); their contacts and sealing plugs are counted there."
    }
  ],
